1 damaged item(s); readable state: snapshot 1 + WAL at commit 3; a repair loses nothing DAMAGE snapshots/00000000000000000000/v-000000.seg at byte 64: chunk checksum mismatch; vertex ids "1"..="6"; donor: not needed: snapshot 1 covers it note: built on snapshot 1 (snapshots/00000000000000000001)
